WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.976
Hi! Today we're at the office.

2
00:00:06.376 --> 00:00:10.800
You ask for help and learn new pronouns.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.172
This is what you find at the office:

4
00:00:15.572 --> 00:00:17.980
the computer

5
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.524
the printer

6
00:00:20.924 --> 00:00:23.308
the meeting

7
00:00:23.708 --> 00:00:27.268
the colleague

8
00:00:27.668 --> 00:00:29.764
the break

9
00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:32.260
the email

10
00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:40.983
Many verbs need the accusative. For example: call me!

11
00:00:41.383 --> 00:00:43.479
ich becomes mich (me)

12
00:00:43.879 --> 00:00:46.023
du becomes dich (you)

13
00:00:46.423 --> 00:00:48.591
er becomes ihn (him)

14
00:00:48.991 --> 00:00:51.159
sie stays sie (her)

15
00:00:51.559 --> 00:00:53.871
and Sie stays Sie.

16
00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:58.671
With helfen you say mir and dir:

17
00:00:59.071 --> 00:01:01.695
Can you help me?

18
00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:05.007
And politely, with Sie:

19
00:01:05.407 --> 00:01:08.031
Can I help you?

20
00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:13.629
Listen: Mateo has a problem.

21
00:01:14.029 --> 00:01:16.653
Can you help me?

22
00:01:17.053 --> 00:01:20.757
Sure! What's up?

23
00:01:21.157 --> 00:01:23.637
The printer isn't working.

24
00:01:24.037 --> 00:01:27.045
Wait, I'll help you.

25
00:01:27.445 --> 00:01:30.237
There, it works again!

26
00:01:30.637 --> 00:01:35.373
Thanks! I'll buy you a coffee.

27
00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:46.339
Now you! Ask a colleague for help: Can you help me? My computer isn't working.

28
00:01:56.033 --> 00:02:00.169
Great! Now you can:

29
00:02:00.569 --> 00:02:06.097
You talk at the office, ask for help and know the pronouns.

30
00:02:06.497 --> 00:02:08.617
See you soon!
